WEBVTT

00:13:59.036 --> 00:14:01.556
The city began, years ago,

00:14:01.596 --> 00:14:03.996
to develop as a city
for walkers and bikers.

00:14:04.036 --> 00:14:08.036
And that's one of the things
that I really love about the city.

00:14:08.076 --> 00:14:09.876
Thinking of a city this way

00:14:09.876 --> 00:14:12.956
is about thinking how you organize
your everyday life,

00:14:12.996 --> 00:14:15.316
where you can buy your groceries,

00:14:15.316 --> 00:14:17.476
whether you can go to work,

00:14:17.476 --> 00:14:21.516
whether your kids can use their bicycle
to [go to] the sports activities.

00:14:21.556 --> 00:14:24.236
This is about streets,
it's about locations.

00:14:24.636 --> 00:14:29.196
It is about safe cycling paths
and shortcuts for walking.

00:14:29.236 --> 00:14:31.676
And connecting it all
to the rest of the city